                                             rdfs:comment "NCIT Match" ,
                                                          "One of the paired female reproductive glands containing the ova or germ cells; the ovary's stroma is a vascular connective tissue containing numbers of ovarian follicles enclosing the ova. [Definition Source: NCIT]" ;
                                             rdfs:label "Ovary" .


