                                             rdfs:comment "NCIT Match" ,
                                                          "The distensible sac-like organ that functions as a reservoir of urine, collecting from the kidneys and eliminating via the urethra. [Definition Source: NCIT]" ;
                                             rdfs:label "Bladder" .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C12419
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C12419> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
