                                             rdfs:comment "NCIT Match" ,
                                                          "The part of the nervous system that consists of the brain, spinal cord, and meninges. [Definition Source: NCIT]" ;
                                             rdfs:label "Central Nervous System" .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C12439
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C12439> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                      skos:Concept ,
                                                      <https://w3id.org/brainteaser/ontology/schema/AnatomicalSite> ;
                                             skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema/conceptScheme/AnatomicSite> ;
                                             gutprop:containedIn <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/bbbf7a6412d6d3e8> ,
                                                                 <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/fe64f285eb67b3a6> ,
