                                             gutprop:containedIn <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/59f6b5a0c57f3c17> ;
                                             rdfs:comment "A stretch of repetitive nucleotide sequences (TTAGGG repeats in humans) found at both ends of each chromatid arm that plays a role in chromosome stability during replication. [Definition Source: NCIT]" ,
