                                                            <https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0014441> ;
                                             rdfs:comment "A living organism that has membranous cell walls, requires oxygen and organic foods, and is capable of voluntary movement, as distinguished from a plant or mineral. [Definition Source: NCIT]" ,
                                                          "NCIT Match" ;
