                                              gutprop:containedIn <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/2531687fe7f85de9> ;
                                              rdfs:comment "NCIT Match" ,
                                                           "The determination of the amount of SARS-CoV-1 and/or SARS-CoV-2 Antigen in a biological sample. [Definition Source: NCIT]" ;
                                              rdfs:label "Sars-Cov-1/Sars-Cov-2 Antigen Measurement" .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C174450
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C174450> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                       skos:Concept ,
