                                              rdfs:comment "An inflammatory process characterized by the presence of lymphocytes and plasma cells and the absence of polymorphonuclear neutrophils. [Definition Source: NCIT]" ,
                                                           "NCIT Match" ;
                                              rdfs:label "Chronic Inflammation" .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C17467
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C17467> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
