                                                                <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/abdebbd994e99621> ,
                                                                <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/b57671d76d32f376> ,
                                                                <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/2c79c70083c5604e> ,
                                                                <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/49302a39ee613fb2> ,
