###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C687
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C687> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                    skos:Concept ,
                                                    gutprop:Chemical ;
                                           skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema/conceptScheme/Chemical> ;
