                                             rdfs:comment "A disorder diagnosed in childhood or adolescence age group characterized by aggressive behavior, deceitfulness, destruction of property or violation of rules that is persistent and repetitive, and within a one year period. [Definition Source: NCIT]" ,
                                                          "NCIT Match" ;
