                                                    rdfs:comment "A method of studying a drug or procedure in which both the subjects and investigators are kept unaware of who is actually getting which specific treatment. [Definition Source: UMLS]" ,
                                                                 "UMLS Match" ;
                                                    rdfs:label "Double-Blind Method" .


###  https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0013227
<https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0013227> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
