                                                    gutprop:target <https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/68010361> ;
                                                    rdfs:comment "A Functional Disorder Of Intestine is a condition characterized by altered bowel habits, abdominal pain, and other symptoms in the absence of any detectable organic cause or structural abnormality. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]" ,
                                                                 "UMLS Match" ;
                                                    rdfs:label "Functional Disorder Of Intestine" .


###  https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0017362
<https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0017362> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
