                                                    rdfs:comment "Intestinal Diseases: A collective term for a range of disorders affecting the small and large intestines, including inflammatory bowel disease, malabsorption syndromes, and gastrointestinal infections. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]" ,
                                                                 "UMLS Match" ;
                                                    rdfs:label "Intestinal Diseases" .


###  https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0022104
<https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0022104> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                             skos:Concept ,
