                                                                   <https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/68010361> ;
                                                    rdfs:comment "A disorder with chronic or recurrent colonic symptoms without a clearcut etiology. This condition is characterized by chronic or recurrent ABDOMINAL PAIN, bloating, MUCUS in FECES, and an erratic disturbance of DEFECATION. [Definition Source: UMLS]" ,
                                                                 "UMLS Match" ;
                                                    rdfs:label "Irritable Bowel Syndrome" .


###  https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0022108
<https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0022108> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
