                                                    rdfs:comment "Liver Diseases refer to a group of disorders that affect the liver, including inflammatory, metabolic, and neoplastic conditions, such as hepatitis, cirrhosis, and liver cancer. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]" ,
                                                                 "UMLS Match" ;
                                                    rdfs:label "Liver Diseases" .


