###  https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0028723
<https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0028723> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                             skos:Concept ,
                                                             gutprop:Food ;
                                                    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema/conceptScheme/Food> ;
