###  https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0034980
<https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0034980> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                             skos:Concept ,
                                                             gutprop:StatisticalTechnique ;
                                                    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema/conceptScheme/StatisticalTechnique> ;
                                                    gutprop:containedIn <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/b4879215cc866abf> ,
