                                                                        <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/87f54d20778ed5a5> ;
                                                    rdfs:comment "The subject's ability to connect 25 numbered and lettered circles in sequence in a specific length of time. A score of 12 or below is suggestive of organic brain damage. [Definition Source: UMLS]" ,
                                                                 "UMLS Match" ;
                                                    rdfs:label "Trail Making Test" .


###  https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0040616
