###  https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C1254351
<https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C1254351> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                             skos:Concept ,
                                                             gutprop:Drug ;
                                                    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema/conceptScheme/Drug> ;
