###  https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/anatomicsite/PeripheralGut
<https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/anatomicsite/PeripheralGut> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
