###  https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/sentence/36191806_11
<https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/sentence/36191806_11> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                       gutprop:Sentence ;
                                                                              gutprop:partOf <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/abstract/36191806> ;
                                                                              gutprop:hasSentenceText "These data suggest that Chrna7 KO mice produce depression-like behaviors and reduced expression of synaptic proteins in the mPFC through gut-microbiota-brain axis via subdiaphragmatic vagus nerve." ;
                                                                              rdfs:label "sentence_36191806_11" .


###  https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/sentence/36191806_2
