###  https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/sentence/37368331_3
<https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/sentence/37368331_3> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                      gutprop:Sentence ;
                                                                             gutprop:partOf <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/abstract/37368331> ;
                                                                             gutprop:hasSentenceText "This systematic review aims to gather existing data on the occidental hemisphere, compare it, and search for any significant association between Parkinson's disease and gut microbiota dysbiosis." ;
                                                                             rdfs:label "sentence_37368331_3" .


