###  https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/statisticaltechnique/CochraneRiskOfBias
<https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/statisticaltechnique/CochraneRiskOfBias> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
