                                                                                                 dcterms:creator "Samuel Piron" ;
                                                                                                 rdfs:comment "Cochrane Risk of Bias is a tool used to assess the quality of evidence in systematic reviews by evaluating the risk of bias in individual studies, considering factors such as randomization, allocation concealment, and blinding. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]" ;
                                                                                                 rdfs:label "Cochrane Risk Of Bia" .


###  https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/statisticaltechnique/InverseVarianceWeightedMrAnalysis
<https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/statisticaltechnique/InverseVarianceWeightedMrAnalysis> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
