###  https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/statisticaltechnique/MrEggerInterceptTest
<https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/statisticaltechnique/MrEggerInterceptTest> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                            skos:Concept ,
                                                                                                            gutprop:StatisticalTechnique ;
