                                                                                            rdfs:comment "The MR Steiger test is a method in Mendelian Randomization used to determine the direction of causality between an exposure and an outcome by comparing the proportion of variance explained by genetic instruments in each trait. [Definition Source: OpenAi 4o]" ;
                                                                                            rdfs:label "Mr Steiger Test" .


###  https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/statisticaltechnique/PredictiveAnalysisMethod
